{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "FluxChat User & Contacts Service",
    "description": "\n# 👤 FluxChat User & Contacts Service\n\nThe **User Service** manages user profiles, public identity lookup, directory search, and bilateral contact requests.\n\n## Capabilities\n- **Profile Management**: Bio, display name, avatar, telephone number, and privacy preferences.\n- **Directory Search**: Fast indexed search across usernames, emails, and phone numbers.\n- **Contacts Handshake**: Bilateral connection requests (`pending`, `accepted`, `rejected`, `cancelled`).\n- **Roster Retrieval**: Bilateral friendship roster with reciprocal validation.\n",
    "contact": {
      "name": "FluxChat Engineering Team",
      "url": "https://github.com/Jyoti-jitu/chat-app"
    },
    "license": {
      "name": "MIT License"
    },
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
